      "updated": 1776985592104,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In the follow database, we store how users are connected to\neach other.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In the follow database, we store how users are connected to each other.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2_JPWRZ6gSH2u6TGsW0a2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15739.086429381221,
      "y": 44029.417716303404,
      "width": 385.8957824707031,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 389765923,
      "version": 19,
      "versionNonce": 1314272877,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776985592104,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each user is like a node (point)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each user is like a node (point)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xcO08ZoyXn37DrZLX83O8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15557.142566466182,
      "y": 44056.917716303404,
      "width": 749.7835083007812,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 286629005,
      "version": 19,
      "versionNonce": 304116451,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776985592104,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each follow or friendship is like a connection (line) between\nusers",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each follow or friendship is like a connection (line) between users",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6c6N1_laB___MkVnEC3TY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15891.450652559151,
      "y": 44489.089909258095,
      "width": 761.4035034179688,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2028158765,
      "version": 194,
      "versionNonce": 2071284707,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776985713947,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In the follow database, we store how users are connected to\neach other.\n\nEach user is like a node (point)\nEach follow or friendship is like a connection (line) between\nusers",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In the follow database, we store how users are connected to each other.\n\nEach user is like a node (point)\nEach follow or friendship is like a connection (line) between users",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "W15vV0mOwkjSqwTC3NKY2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15891.450652559151,
      "y": 44489.089909258095,
      "width": 761.4035034179688,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1919237229,
      "version": 196,
      "versionNonce": 994563971,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776985713947,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In the follow database, we store how users are connected to\neach other.\n\nEach user is like a node (point)\nEach follow or friendship is like a connection (line) between\nusers",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In the follow database, we store how users are connected to each other.\n\nEach user is like a node (point)\nEach follow or friendship is like a connection (line) between users",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "P1uM_YXY-GwEj5zvBhWO3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15923.503020495184,
      "y": 44045.79354688641,
      "width": 2494.60205078125,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1198113635,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1866955405,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776985655474,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Using graph relationship will also help to efficiently find followers and followes list for a user very efficiently. Also, we need to support a large number of users and their relationship with each other.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Using graph relationship will also help to efficiently find followers and followes list for a user very efficiently. Also, we need to support a large number of users and their relationship with each other.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
